        "content": "<p>I'm trying to learn <code>vcgen</code> (on 4.33-rc1) by implementing a small lambda calculus with axiomatic semantics. I've noticed that in these examples I need to exit <code>vcgen</code>, either explicitly stopping on a <code>subst</code>, or stopping when some <code>simp</code> step is required to progress the proof:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lang</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bol</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lam</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"x\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"x\"</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lang</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">epost</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">vcgen</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">vcgen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">until</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lang</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subst</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">vcgen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">finish</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I'm wondering if in the current prototype is there some <code>vcgen</code>-fu I might be able to use to make this go through in a single call? Here is my <a href=\"https://live.lean-lang.org/#codez=JYWwDg9gTgLgBAZRgEwHQBUCGBjGxuoAiEAUKJLIiqgJIB2MAplHZgDZGkkDOjMA%2BhDB4IdOCABu2AOaM6qAO6YWwOtLgAzdrxIkhcqmnpMW7TrtXIArrmATGcADKY1cBQAtmjEnDgAfOAllOAAKbjgALiooVWkASh9%2FODZMEFDwqKQYtTjQgCMIZABPSKcXeMSAzDAwUIdMUuccyrhWeBCxKIA5TBgE3yrkZFC2OChG8v6kgtGQvNKAIQgINimA4CZQ7Dh4DQnmsjprW3s4Gm4ANXYrByim9UAkwjgABSghN08obwHW3tLzq5sG6hVBtOD8OhrOAzf6Xa4OEKoGH8PJQlJpKIA%2BEg9HggAe4MYCRIyEYe0BwKi6CKYAc%2FEiAF44ABvZL7dQ